{"content": """"DSV41Int4Config: W4A16 variant-A quantization for DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash.

Claimed when the checkpoint's config.json carries
  "quantization_config": {"quant_method": "dsv41_int4"}  (or expert_dtype == "int4")

Routing inside the model:
- all LinearBase (dense attn / shared_experts / engram.wkv / ...) -> bf16
  (UnquantizedLinearMethod; our dense tensors are int4-dequantized bf16)
- RoutedExperts -> Int4ExpertsMethod (packed int4 + fp16 scale, Triton W4A16 GEMM)
- ParallelEngramEmbedding is NOT a QuantMethod target; see engram_patch.py.
"""
from typing import Any, Optional

import torch
from vllm.model_executor.layers.quantization.base_config import QuantizationConfig, QuantizeMethodBase
from vllm.model_executor.layers.quantization.unquantized import UnquantizedLinearMethod

