Claims checkpoints whose config.json declares auto-round's auto_gptq packing:
  "quantization_config": {"quant_method": "auto-round",
                          "packing_format": "auto_round:auto_gptq", "bits": 4, ...}

Layer routing (everything delegated to vLLM built-ins, zero custom kernels):
- LinearBase (dense fp8 layers, kept as-is by the export)  -> DeepseekV4FP8Config's
  ModelOptLinearMethod (mxfp8 32x32 + e8m0, same as the official baseline).
- RoutedExperts (auto_gptq int4 triplets)                  -> AutoGPTQConfig's MoE
  path (GPTQ MoE Marlin / MoeWNA16 fallback).

So `auto-round --model_free --ignore_layers <dense families>` output serves directly.
Only claims deepseek_v4-family models (hf_config.model_type check).
