{"content": """"DSV41AutoRoundMxfpConfig: auto-round mxfp (llm_compressor packing) for DeepSeek-V4.1.

Claimed when the checkpoint's config.json declares auto-round's MXFP style:
  "quantization_config": {"quant_method": "auto-round",
                          "packing_format": "auto_round:llm_compressor", ...}
on a deepseek_v4-family model. (``auto_round:auto_gptq`` packings are claimed by
DSV41AutoRoundConfig; non-deepseek_v4 auto-round checkpoints fall through to vLLM's
built-in INCConfig.)

Dispatch (per module type, config-declaration-free):
- LinearBase dense (OCP MXFP8 rowwise on disk: ``.weight`` fp8_e4m3 +
  ``.weight_scale`` uint8 e8m0 [N, K/32]) -> ``INCLinearMethod(INCMxfp8LinearScheme())``,
  i.e. vLLM's INC/auto-round-path MXFP8 kernel (weight static mxfp8 + dynamic mxfp8
  activations, same compute recipe as the official baseline's dense path).
- RoutedExperts (official packed MXFP4 ``.weight`` int8 + ``.scale`` e8m0) ->
  built-in Deepseek-V4.1 FP4 MoE path (delegated, bytes untouched).
- "gate" in prefix -> UnquantizedLinearMethod (MoE router stays bf16).
- Engram embed tables -> the plugin's env-gated patch (DSV41_ENGRAM_DTYPE), unchanged.
"""
from typing import Any, Optional

import torch
from vllm.model_executor.layers.quantization.base_config import QuantizationConfig, QuantizeMethodBase

_FP8_OFFICIAL_CFG = {
    "quant_method": "fp8",
